Infrastructure Configuration: Nginx Ingress Reverse Proxy
File: `/etc/nginx/sites-available/app.conf`

```nginx
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name app.example.com;

    location /api/ {
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8000/;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
    }
}
```
Ensure that the upstream backend port 8000 is bound strictly to loopback and not exposed on public network interfaces.

Konfigurasi Pelayan Web: Nginx Reverse Proxy (Pelayan API)
Fail: `/etc/nginx/conf.d/api.conf`

```nginx
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name api.kedaikita.example.my;

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8080;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $remote_addr;
    }
}
```
Pastikan perkhidmatan API pada port 8080 diikat secara eksklusif pada antara muka tempatan `127.0.0.1` dan tidak dibuka kepada orang awam.

Catatan Review Kode (Merge Request #145): 'Pencegahan SSRF pada modul pratinjau tautan'
Reviewer: Gilang (Security Engineer)
Status: Approved

Implementasi validasi alamat IP pada `url_validator.go` sudah tepat:
```go
func IsSafeIP(ip net.IP) bool {
    // Memblokir IP privat, loopback, dan multicast
    if ip.IsLoopback() || ip.IsPrivate() || ip.IsLinkLocalUnicast() {
        return false
    }
    return true
}
```
Fungsi ini sukses mencegah penyerang memanfaatkan fitur preview untuk memindai port lokal server.
